                                "sense_id": "90825f03-a4d5-3db2-bd09-eb1081b2d1ee",
                                "text": "Zur Begrüßung wurde den Testpersonen bei einer Testsitzung ein Milchshake gereicht.",
                                "translation": "The test subjects were greeted at a test session with a milkshake.",
                                "english": "The test subjects were greeted at a test session with a milkshake."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be6771f9-7fe8-4a98-90ed-c624a80550c1",
                                "sense_id": "90825f03-a4d5-3db2-bd09-eb1081b2d1ee",
                                "text": "Ein amerikanisches Fast-Food-Restaurant wollte den Abverkauf seiner Milchshakes erhöhen und mit diesem Ziel sollte auch das Produkt verbessert werden.",
                                "translation": "An American fast-food restaurant wanted to increase sales of its milkshakes, and along with that goal the product was also to be improved.",
                                "english": "An American fast-food restaurant wanted to increase sales of its milkshakes, and along with that goal the product was also to be improved."
